          "description": "Hello, crafty kids! Welcome to the 'Little Creators Studio' by Momma Bear Audio! Here, we'll dive into a world of fun and creativity, one craft at a time. Each craft is a new adventure. Together, we'll explore, create, and learn, using just our hands, some crafting materials and our imagination. So gather your crafting supplies, and let's get ready to make some magic! Remember, every craft we make is a masterpiece! You know why? It’s because it's made by you! Okay let’s craft!!",
